WEBVTT

00:21:29.557 --> 00:21:32.428
about the possibility
of resurrection and recovery,

00:21:32.452 --> 00:21:34.272
but it actually happens.

00:21:34.296 --> 00:21:35.976
And it happens a lot.

00:21:36.538 --> 00:21:40.849
Perhaps the most popular
resurrection theme,

00:21:40.873 --> 00:21:43.659
outside of specifically religious ones,

00:21:43.683 --> 00:21:47.527
is the one about the phoenix,
the ancient story of the phoenix,

00:21:47.551 --> 00:21:50.059
who, every 500 years,

00:21:50.083 --> 00:21:53.800
resurrects itself from its own ashes

00:21:53.824 --> 00:21:56.596
to go on to live a life

00:21:56.620 --> 00:22:00.207
that is even more beautiful
than it was before.